{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2021-12", "window": 3, "start_date": 1639612800, "end_date": 1640303999, "month_true_total": 191, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:56:06 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "106382780", "author": {"steamid": "76561198164309022", "personaname": "Dáin II Ironfoot", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/batukhagan/", "num_games_owned": 539, "num_reviews": 93, "playtime_forever": 70, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 63, "last_played": 1640296285, "avatar": "7419c915f5e65f18a92b685122e3d8b7ae633281"}, "language": "english", "review": "Boring af, I would play Warframe instead of this. Also Warframe is free but it sux too.", "timestamp_created": 1640296051, "timestamp_updated": 1640296051, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.311188966035842896", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106379570", "author": {"steamid": "76561198815267817", "personaname": "Pr0t0Zer0", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Pr0t0ZerO/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 511, "playtime_forever": 59, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 59, "last_played": 1640313032, "avatar": "c9af9f78f6d4f28dd5e08e92182b103c4cd6959a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Im requesting a refund. I really wanted to play the game but even at geforce experience recommended settings, and despite meeting system requirements, it constantly eats my gpu at 100%. Ive played more graphically intense games at higher settings without this issue. Also I dont know if its inherent to the game, or my specific issue with my gpu but rendering was also an issue, including pop in, muddy textures and pixelated faces. And the face mapping and expressions are still really flat. I was hoping after a while the game would have been fixed and been a good deal on sale. But its not even worth the 7$ im insulted having spent on it.", "timestamp_created": 1640292587, "timestamp_updated": 1640313576, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106352557", "author": {"steamid": "76561198367951755", "personaname": "Darth Ridley", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198367951755/", "num_games_owned": 291, "num_reviews": 159, "playtime_forever": 5674, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5420, "last_played": 1696683347, "avatar": "8f5ebc2f3fb1d7ba9531d0c3de9a5c8379d47449"}, "language": "english", "review": "A great adventure, worthy of being part of Mass Effect franchise. Can't really say anything more than that. I am pleased that I bought it. There is, however, another thing that I am not pleased of...\n\nI bought MEA several years after the initial release, but I am somewhat aware of its rocky launch. And the reaction of Bioware \"fans\".\n\nWas I surprised that Mass Effect community is a cesspool of toxic basement dwellers? No.\nWas I disappointed that the companies refused to take a stand and defend their product? Yes. EA and Bioware, I like you, but what the фак? For example, Fallout 4 had a similar history, but Bethesda stood firm - not only fixing everything in a timely manner, but releasing ALL the DLCs, as they promised. The rating and reviews of F4 raised from Mixed(56%) to Very Positive(91%). And you just gave up...", "timestamp_created": 1640264477, "timestamp_updated": 1640264477, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49238935112953186", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106346996", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046440340", "personaname": "gartopa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198046440340/", "num_games_owned": 52, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 398, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 391, "last_played": 1640257680, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "PC controls ruin game.", "timestamp_created": 1640257161, "timestamp_updated": 1640257161, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.354495644569396973", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "106342280", "author": {"steamid": "76561198348572323", "personaname": "RedEyeVladKing1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/2134876524/", "num_games_owned": 130, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 3904, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 387, "last_played": 1676017766, "avatar": "f3d05db4d8557efbcdbfb337f4176abe9fcb5c1b"}, "language": "english", "review": "love it!", "timestamp_created": 1640249906, "timestamp_updated": 1640249906, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}